      * Synthetic golden-file fixture for KnowFlow parser T2.
      * USAGE variants and SIGN SEPARATE, no business meaning.
       01 SAMPLE-USAGES.
         05 BIN-SMALL        PIC S9(3) COMP.
         05 BIN-LARGE        PIC S9(8) BINARY.
         05 FLOAT-SINGLE     COMP-1.
         05 FLOAT-DOUBLE     COMP-2.
         05 PACKED-ALT       PIC S9(5)V99 PACKED-DECIMAL.
         05 SIGNED-DISPLAY   PIC S9(4) SIGN IS TRAILING SEPARATE.
